msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:29
#: 415e4b1dcbf14ef08f4ea5d06c6de3a7
msgid "**Overview:** Atmel Studio or Microsoft Visual Studio provides a robust Integrated Development Environment (IDE). However, the ArduPilot code is set up to use the special ArduPilot Arduino IDE and that structure does not work in those environments without some plugin to setup the correct structure and provide the up-load tools. Finding the source code for the various functions and classes is difficult using Arduino - sometimes requiring a manual search through multiple folders and files to find the actual source code for one function or class used in the main code setup or loop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:39
#: 97adb3806a804bfcbbc6785723953c71
msgid "**Solution:** Visual Micro solves most of these problems. Visual Micro is a plugin to Atmel Studio or Visual Studio that adds the following features:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:43
#: 978c17758ff84deabccb48f4a87f44a1
msgid "Compatibility with the Arduino Code structure, libraries, file naming and sketches - with the robust studio IDE."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:45
#: 7e4c0162ca0d432981c7c3f34ee35367
msgid "Uploading Arduino sketches to any of the Arduino boards - and, to the APM boards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:47
#: 1dc21bb0246b4e54a06518d671f41fe7
msgid "All the files are shown in the solution panel, making it easy to open, browse or edit any file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:49
#: 435cd7b6ef314b908dab4fe355b64437
msgid "Take a look at the \\ `Visual Micro <https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ website for all the details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:50
#: ab3fd4198d5743e79fd4b33e21802a92
msgid "Visual Micro has a debug feature when used with standard Arduino sketches but the APM code has removed or modified much of the standard Arduino features like Serial.print() and the hardware Serial features. The Visual Micro debugger does not work with APM. However, do not let that dissuade you from trying the Atmel Studio or Visual Studio IDE."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-ardupilot-apm-with-visual-studio-visual-micro.rst:57
#: cf44d2cf8a724b4c84d457d5277c30aa
msgid "Here you will find a step by step process to set up Atmel Studio or Visual Studio to browse, edit, build and upload the APM code.  Special thanks to Tim Leek at Visual Micro for developing this great plugin and for his help in creating this document."
