#: 9222df57b7394798b273c6b354870441
msgid "The  `Visual Micro <https://www.visualmicro.com/>`__ website explains how to install Visual Micro for Arduino and how to set up Atmel Studio or Visual Studio to work with Arduino sketches and boards. What is not clearly covered is how to add support for the APM boards. Once that information is clear, the set up is quite simple. Here is a summary of the key steps required:"
